From 5ea8c0e43f88e6c6d1f9dbe305bc3abc347bce8c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?St=C3=A9phane=20Graber?= <stgraber@stgraber.org>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 20:11:12 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] incusd/project: Check restrictions on snapshots received
 through copy and migration
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Snapshots created from a migration header or a source instance's
snapshots were recorded with whatever config and devices they carried,
bypassing the project's restricted.* checks that apply to the instance.

This addresses GHSA-5pf7-5wqc-rp52 (CVE pending)

Signed-off-by: Stéphane Graber <stgraber@stgraber.org>
(cherry picked from commit a017fc7d93c5ac36f3c88079726d040005580f5f)
